# Self-update channel — copy to update.properties (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# github.token          fine-grained PAT, ONLY this repo, Contents: Read-only.
#                       This one ships inside the APK — anyone holding the APK can read
#                       the repo. Accepted trade-off for a friends-only distribution.
# github.release_token  fine-grained PAT, ONLY this repo, Contents: Read+Write.
#                       Never embedded in the app — used by tools/release.sh on the PC.
#
# The repo must be private with versioned Releases carrying .apk assets
# (tools/release.sh builds and publishes them).

github.owner=MrKaa001
github.repo=tg-ws-proxy-android
github.token=
github.release_token=
